      "claim": "When a woman who is pregnant has lupus, it can lead to symptoms of lupus in the baby (called neonatal lupus). The most serious complication of neonatal lupus is a heart rhythm problem called congenital heart block. Hydroxychloroquine might reduce the chance of congenital heart block in pregnancies that are at an increased risk for this condition.",
